        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>有效再构教学文本</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    width: 540px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n  }\n  /* 顶部截图区域 */\n  .screenshot {\n    position: relative;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 0 0 6px 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #dcdcdc;\n  }\n  .tab-bar {\n    background: #4a4a5a;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    padding: 5px 12px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 100%;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .big-title {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -4px;\n    left: 218px;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    color: #111111;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    z-index: 5;\n    text-shadow:\n      -2px -2px 0 #fff, 2px -2px 0 #fff,\n      -2px 2px 0 #fff, 2px 2px 0 #fff;\n  }\n  .doc-heading {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    margin: 26px 0 10px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .doc-body {\n    padding: 0 26px;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .doc-body p {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .circled {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 2px solid #e8820c;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 5px;\n    margin: 0 1px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  .wave {\n    border-bottom: 3px dotted #f06292;\n    padding-bottom: 1px;\n  }\n  .avatar {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 14px;\n    bottom: 6px;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #cfd8dc;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    color: #607d8b;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  /* 下半部分正文 */\n  .lower {\n    padding: 16px 26px 20px 26px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    color: #d81b60;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    margin: 6px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .lower p {\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 2.0;\n    color: #111111;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"screenshot\">\n    <div class=\"tab-bar\">单元整体教学设计过程</div>\n    <div class=\"big-title\">2·再构文本</div>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-heading\">有效再构教学文本</div>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-body\">\n      <p>文本再构能够有效解决教材不能满足现实教学需求的问题，从而为实现对单元主题的深度学习、培养学生的学科核心素养提供基础保障。</p>\n      <p>首先它需要教师基于单元主题及主题意义，合理划分各单课时话题。每个单课时话题不仅要与主题之间存在关联性、递进性，凸显对主题意义的探究。</p>\n      <p>其次，在明确了各课课时的话题后，教师可以将教材中的教学内容根据分课时话题教学需要及学生已有的知识储备情况，进行一定<span class=\"circled\">重组</span> <span class=\"circled\">调整</span> <span class=\"circled\">删减</span> <span class=\"circled\">补充</span>或延伸，使教学文本内容更具层次、语言更为丰富、呈现方式更加多样，情境更加贴近学生现实生活，<span class=\"wave\">更有利于培养学生的语用能力和核心素养。</span></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"avatar\">[Photo]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"lower\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">1. 树立正确的教材观</div>\n    <p>教师在日常教学中不能被教材所束缚，按部就班地按照教材来教，而应该做“教材的主人”，<span class=\"wave\">创造性地使用教材。</span></p>\n    <p>教师以单元为单位，深度挖掘教学文本潜藏的育人价值，并将文本解读与学情分析结合起来，提炼单元主题意义，并基于此有效整合教学内容，再构教学文本。这样一来可以帮助教师开展有逻辑、有层次的单元主题教学，可以帮助学生形成对单元主题逐步深入的认知。</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
